<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said early bids on barrows and gilts traded unevenly steady to $1.00 lower in a light test. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 54.75-56.00</p>
</text>
